      "writtenOn": "2024-03-20T16:29:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Packaging still happens in Make, so you generally need to export the output of each Soong module to Make.  Passing just the first output file as `AndroidMkEntries.OutputFile` might be sufficient though, Soong is handling the installation of each file and `build/soong/android/androidmk.go` is passing all of the installed files to Make via `LOCAL_SOONG_INSTALL_PAIRS`, so maybe everything would just work?",
